Subject: [PATCH 1/1] U9 (Round-11): standalone runner provenance manifest

Adds build_provenance_manifest()/write_provenance_manifest() and a
--emit-provenance CLI path: sanitized git context (credential-stripped
remotes, branch, describe), runtime (python + implementation + platform),
material dependency versions (numpy/gemmi, explicitly 'unavailable' when
missing), and the policy-binding hashes, composed with the existing
engine provenance (code_sha + tree state). run_manifest.json now also
carries the git block and dependencies.

Delivered as a patch only (owner-gated merge); base
science/p0-correctness-2026-10-19 @ ebc1fd79.
